<title>UK: W.H.Smith H1 pretax profits soar.</title>
<headline>W.H.Smith H1 pretax profits soar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending November 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.3		    vs 4.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.25		   vs 5.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     38.6		   vs 17.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,290.7		vs 1,355.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 36.0 and 38.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - W. H. Smith Group Plc</p>
</text>
